Source code of the GPL and LGPL software MDMesh redistributes:

  The MDMesh container images (mdmesh-server, mdmesh-web and
  mdmesh-supervisor) contain, unmodified, software that the MDMesh
  contributors did not write and that is licensed under the GNU General
  Public License (GPL) or the GNU Lesser General Public License (LGPL):
